  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU in the Mediterranean Youth Academy &#xBF; Second Edition - New Request</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;EU&#xBF;s participation in the Mediterranean Youth Academy &#xBF; Second Edition from 14&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; to 19&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;/sup&gt; September 2022 in Alexandria will contribute to enhancing Euro-Mediterranean youth dialogue and contribute to all crosscutting priorities of the EU: environment and climate change, rights based approach, persons with disability, indigenous peoples and gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
